{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"港鐵天水圍站故障工程車已駛離行車綫　屯馬綫服務逐步回復正常\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/MTR-DELAY-261126-0630.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】港鐵天水圍站故障的工程車已駛離行車綫，屯馬綫列車服務逐步回復正常。</p><p>早上近六時，港鐵天水圍站有工程車設備故障，屯馬綫候車時間一度較平日多10至15分鐘。工程人員約二十多分鐘後將工程車移離行車綫，列車服務逐步回復正常。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T23:57:37.200807+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T23:03:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T18:37:51.259683+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T23:51:07.123117+00:00","content_hash":"090cc48ccbd1682cfd9519dfba87cd83982ab02e32918c9cb54f05c3567ee1d9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}